{"version":"https://jsonfeed.org/version/1.1","title":"五阅五使 - 标签","description":"这里不仅是我研习中医经典的私人书斋，更是一处致力于 “观照经典以明医理，颐养身心以扶正气” 的清净之地。","home_page_url":"https://lruihao.cn/","language":"zh-CN","icon":"https://lruihao.cn/apple-touch-icon.png","favicon":"https://lruihao.cn/favicon.ico","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://acuherb.xyz/images/avatar.png"}],"items":[{"title":"五阅五使第三十七","date_published":"2025-08-27T18:22:22&#43;08:00","date_modified":"2026-08-26T10:48:21Z","id":"https://lruihao.cn/posts/lingshu-37/","url":"https://lruihao.cn/posts/lingshu-37/","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://gravatar.loli.net/avatar/89719985bb81a6f9d508808413f1b999?s=32&amp;d=mp"}],"tags":["五阅五使"],"summary":"阅，《说文》云\u0026quot;察也\u0026quot;。五阅，指五脏的外候。五使，指面部五气为五脏所使。本篇主要讲述了人之脏腑疾病可以从五官五色的变化测知，故以\u0026quot;五阅五使\u0026quot;名篇。","content_html":"阅，《说文》云\u0026quot;察也\u0026quot;。五阅，指五脏的外候。五使，指面部五气为五脏所使。本篇主要讲述了人之脏腑疾病可以从五官五色的变化测知，故以\u0026quot;五阅五使\u0026quot;名篇。"}]}